# Public (non-secret) build + runtime config. Gitignored by Nuxt convention,
# so this file is local to whatever machine runs `pnpm build`. The values are
# baked into prerendered pages at build time.
#
# Paste the real container id below once created at tagmanager.google.com.
# Leave blank to keep analytics + the consent banner fully disabled.
NUXT_PUBLIC_GTM_ID=GTM-NLQS39PR
NUXT_PUBLIC_CONSENT_COOKIE_DOMAIN=.foldingathome.org
